    "text": "Professional Summary",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 105.56697
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "Backend engineer with nine years on data\u2011heavy services. Works on the parts of a",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 131.3745
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "system that are hard to change later: schemas, queue semantics, and the paths that",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 144.2
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "stay correct when a dependency is slow. Comfortable owning a service end\u2011to\u2011end,",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 157.0255
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "from the migration plan through to the dashboard the on\u2011call rota actually reads.",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 169.851
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "Employment History",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 194.302
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "Senior Software Engineer, Northwind Systems, Portland, Oregon",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 220.624
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "MARCH 2022 - PRESENT",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 237.311
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Split a single write\u2011heavy orders table into four services, keeping a read\u2011only",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 248.60844
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "compatibility view in place so the seventeen callers could migrate one at a time",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 261.434
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "rather than in a single coordinated release.",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 274.25944
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Rewrote the nightly reconciliation job as an incremental consumer of the",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 287.10795
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "change\u2011data\u2011capture stream, which moved the run from four hours to under ten",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 299.9335
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "minutes and removed the overnight staffing rota around it.",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 312.75895
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Introduced per\u2011tenant rate limits at the gateway after a single large import",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 325.6075
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "starved every other tenant for most of an afternoon.",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 338.433
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Wrote the schema\u2011change checklist the team now follows, covering backfills,",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 351.28148
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "dual writes and the order the two deploys must happen in.",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 364.10698
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "Software Engineer, Cobalt Harbor, Remote",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 386.08
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "JUNE 2019 - FEBRUARY 2022",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 402.76698
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Built the billing export used by every downstream finance tool, including the",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 414.0645
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "replay path that lets a corrected invoice be reissued without editing history.",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 426.89
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Added distributed tracing across six services and used it to find a retry loop that",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 439.73848
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "had been doubling database load since launch.",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 452.56398
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Took over an unowned search service, cut its p99 latency by half by removing",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 465.4125
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "an accidental full\u2011text scan, and documented it well enough that two other",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 478.238
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "engineers could take it on.",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 491.0635
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "Software Engineer, Pinegrove Labs, Seattle, Washington",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 513.03648
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "A U G U S T 2 0 1 7 - M AY 2 0 1 9",
    "x": 42.0,
    "y": 529.7235
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Maintained the ingestion pipeline for a mid\u2011size analytics product, moving it",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 541.02098
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "from hand\u2011run scripts to a scheduled, monitored workflow.",
    "x": 64.0,
    "y": 553.84648
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "side": false,
    "text": "\u2022 Added the first integration test suite the team had, which caught two",
    "x": 55.0,
    "y": 566.695
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
